{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Money deposited in a savings account earns interest at an annual rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/d/f9def979737597a3e3933e13418e5aac1e30925a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5.25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />. After how many years would the initial contribution to the account double in value, assuming no withdrawals or additional deposits are made?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c476a4a887f841280c94d64ab6e85af2d835201f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{About } 2 \\text{ years} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{About } 6 \\text{ years}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba15b0a1d34fad4a633946730c275b5962429eac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{About } 8 \\text{ years} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{About } 13 \\text{ years}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"320\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/676facf864dcb78fc74597e7c2ee5f41655a32b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{About } 19 \\text{ years}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/d/f9def979737597a3e3933e13418e5aac1e30925a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5.25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b9bfba70f327a45e61fb7af5d10c4dc1b98e3dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.0525$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />, so the rate of change is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0a37fa63b070766d301c731be9260ce0b53f615.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 0.0525 = 1.0525$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f5163389ddf7dc0e6e6916b583882a973c20ecb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.0525^{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" /> is very close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5d93e3907d928be0f48d100dee8c56ae20b815f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\text{About } 13 \\text{ years}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"161\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=e